WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.500
[Soft heartbeat] You speak 150 words a minute.

00:04.600 --> 00:08.500
[Slow keystrokes] You type 40.

00:08.600 --> 00:12.500
Your voice has always been the faster interface.

00:12.600 --> 00:15.300
[Music builds] OpenVoiceFlow

00:15.400 --> 00:22.100
[Holding the fn key — live waveform] "Ship the beta tonight — the release notes are already in the doc."

00:22.200 --> 00:24.300
[Key released] Transcribing on device… pasted at the cursor.

00:24.400 --> 00:26.300
On-device Whisper. Nothing uploaded. Ever.

00:26.400 --> 00:28.700
Names it never misspells: Anaïs, kubectl, Shimoverse.

00:28.730 --> 00:31.000
Casual in Slack. Formal in Mail.

00:31.070 --> 00:33.300
Say "sig" — it expands to your whole signature.

00:33.400 --> 00:40.300
[Music softens] Your voice never leaves your Mac. Not encrypted-later. Not anonymized. Not sent.

00:40.400 --> 00:42.500
Dictation apps: $144 a year.

00:42.700 --> 00:46.300
[Warm hit] $0. Forever. MIT open source · No account · No cloud.

00:46.400 --> 00:51.900
Speak. It types. Free for macOS 14+ — openvoiceflow.com
